		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-05T06:09:19Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				274,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): comprehensive README restructure with architecture deep-dive\n\nTransform the Cocoon README from concise benefit-focused copy to comprehensive technical documentation. The rewrite adds:\n\n- Welcome section explaining Cocoon's role as Land's VS Code extension host\n- Key Features section detailing Effect-TS architecture, gRPC communication, and process hardening\n- Deep Dive section listing all major source files with their responsibilities\n- Ecosystem table mapping Cocoon components to roles\n- Step-by-step interaction flow for API calls (showInformationMessage example)\n- Mermaid architecture diagram showing data flow\n- Getting Started section with build instructions and key dependencies\n- Debugging guide for Node.js process debugging\n- Changelog reference section\n\nThis provides developers with the full architectural context needed to understand and contribute to Cocoon.",
			"SHA": "2789e3f6025d1992b359891e6b3288eeb487b048"
		},
